-- 3D puppet fixes for the more human figure (no body part through floor, wall, table or chair):
--   wall-sit (back slides along the wall), single-leg-balance (no upward bob), pendulum (palm flat on the table),
--   ankle-alphabet, chin-tuck, sit-to-stand (chair height/position), plank-knees (knees stay on the floor).
-- Safe to run more than once.

